{
  "id": 8835554246855,
  "title": "Custom Patriotic Trucking Semi Truck Below Waving American Flag Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-patriotic-trucking-semi-truck-below-waving-american-flag-comforter-05c0cd8623-05c0cd8623",
  "body_html": "<p>Rev up your bedroom decor with the Custom Semi Truck Bedding Comforter from Jeminise. Perfect for truckers and semi-truck enthusiasts, this soft and cozy comforter set brings patriotic trucking style to your space, customized with your own name input for a personal touch.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a custom name input field to personalize your trucking bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Patriotic Trucking Theme:</strong> Features a semi truck design positioned below a waving American flag over a sunset highway background.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Package options include 1 duvet cover or filled comforter with optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, quick-drying, and lightweight for all-season comfort.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Red Trucker Art</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Patriotic trucking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
